---
// Mini Preview: flexbox（弹性布局）-- 纯静态，零 JS，Gallery/Stream 用
---
<div class="w-full aspect-[16/9] bg-canvas border border-line rounded-card overflow-hidden p-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 bg-card border border-line rounded-control px-3 py-2">
    <span class="text-[10px] text-muted">logo</span>
    <span class="text-[10px] text-ink font-medium">flex: 1 拉伸</span>
    <span class="text-[10px] text-muted">action</span>
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-1 gap-2">
    <div class="flex-1 bg-card border border-line rounded-control flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] text-muted">
      主轴：水平排列
    </div>
    <div class="w-1/4 bg-accent-soft border border-accent-soft rounded-control flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] text-accent-deep">
      交叉轴
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="text-[10px] text-muted text-center">单维度排列：对齐、分布与伸缩</p>
</div>